    {
      "name": "dsh-plugin-suite",
      "title": {
        "en": "Plugin suite",
        "zh": "小插件套件"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Nine small local features in one bundle: file right-click copy, light/dark toggle, per-turn spend, hidden branch button, remembered unpinned panels, right sidebar open by default, one-click archive filter, Chinese approval cards, and a sidebar restart button. Each has its own switch under Settings → Plugin suite, applied immediately. The configuration lives in ~/.dsh/plugin-suite.json.",
        "zh": "把九个自研小功能装进一个插件包：文件右键复制、深浅色切换、每轮花费、隐藏分支按钮、记住取消固定的面板、右侧栏默认展开、归档筛选一键切换、审批界面中文、侧栏重启按钮。设置 → 小插件 里可以逐个开关，改动即时生效。配置保存在 ~/.dsh/plugin-suite.json。"
      },
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yggizz/dsh-plugins/bfae3cbe0bf4e0a1845e054620bc444889cfbaaf/packages/dsh-plugin-suite/icon.svg",
