    {
      "name": "dsh-approval-zh",
      "title": {
        "en": "Chinese approval cards",
        "zh": "审批界面中文"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Shows the approval card's headline in Chinese: DSH's own escalation and auto-review wording comes from an offline dictionary, leftover English prose goes through the Host translator, and tool names, paths, JSON, commands and sandbox modes stay verbatim. Follows the UI language, so an English interface is untouched. A failed translation keeps the original text; decisions are never changed.",
        "zh": "把审批卡标题显示成中文：DSH 自带的越权升级与 auto-review 措辞走离线词典，剩余英文经 Host 翻译服务处理，工具名、路径、JSON、命令与沙箱模式保留原文。跟随界面语言，英文界面不受影响；翻译失败时显示原文，任何审批决策都不会被改动。"
      },
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yggizz/dsh-plugins/665efb70712e9454ce3f387fb8e0c7311eba5db8/packages/dsh-approval-zh/icon.svg",
